        },
        {
          "text": "Amarembo uko ari cumi n'abiri, yari imaragarita cumi n'ebyiri, irembo rimwe ryubakishijwe imaragarita imwe, atyo atyo. Inzira nyabagendwa yo muri urwo rurembo yashigirijwe izahabu nziza isa n'ibirahuri bibonerana.",
          "type": "text",
